{"path":"locale/locale/id","title":"std::locale::id","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::locale::</span>id","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/locale/locale/id","section":"locale","kind":"page","summary":"The class std::locale::id provides implementation-specific identification of a locale facet.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td> <div>Defined in header <code><a href=\"/w/cpp/header/locale\">&lt;locale&gt;</a></code>\n </div></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl\">\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\"> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">class</span> locale<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">id</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>The class <code>std::locale::id</code> provides implementation-specific identification of a locale facet. Each <a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/locale/facet\">facet</a> has a public static member named <code><b>id</b></code> of type <code>std::locale::id</code> and each <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/locale\">std::locale</a></span> object maintains a list of facets it implements, indexed by their <code>id</code>s.\n</p><p>Facets with the same <code>id</code> belong to the same facet category and replace each other when added to a locale object.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Member_functions\">Member functions</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div t-dsc-member-nobold-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/locale/id/id\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>(constructor)</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  constructs a new id <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span>operator=</span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  copy assignment operator is deleted <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span>\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\"><p>The following example shows how to construct a minimal custom facet.</p>\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;locale&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw1\">struct</span> myfacet <span class=\"sy4\">:</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/locale/facet\"><span class=\"kw1912\">std::<span class=\"me2\">locale</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">facet</span></span></a>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    myfacet<span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/types/size_t\"><span class=\"kw107\">std::<span class=\"me2\">size_t</span></span></a> refs <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"nu0\">0</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy4\">:</span> facet<span class=\"br0\">(</span>refs<span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n    <span class=\"kw4\">static</span> <span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">std</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">locale</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">id</span> id<span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\nstd<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">locale</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">id</span> myfacet<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">id</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/locale\"><span class=\"kw1911\">std::<span class=\"me2\">locale</span></span></a> myloc<span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/locale\"><span class=\"kw1911\">std::<span class=\"me2\">locale</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>, new myfacet<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"has_facet&lt;myfacet&gt;(myloc) returns \"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/manip/boolalpha\"><span class=\"kw1781\">std::<span class=\"me2\">boolalpha</span></span></a>\n              <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/has_facet\"><span class=\"kw1914\">std::<span class=\"me2\">has_facet</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>myfacet<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>myloc<span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>has_facet&lt;myfacet&gt;(myloc) returns true</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/locale/facet\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>facet</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  the base class for all facet categories: each facet of any category is derived from this type <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(class)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Member functions","id":"Member_functions"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"locale","title":"Localization library"},{"path":"locale/locale","title":"std::locale"}],"children":[{"path":"locale/locale/id/id","title":"std::locale::id::id"}],"map":{"label":"std::locale::id","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration. The class std::locale::id provides implementation-specific identification of a locale facet."},{"label":"Member functions","children":[{"label":"(constructor)","note":"constructs a new id"},{"label":"operator=","note":"copy assignment operator is deleted"}]},{"label":"Example","note":"The following example shows how to construct a minimal custom facet."},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"facet","note":"the base class for all facet categories: each facet of any category is derived from this type"}]}]},"standards":[],"wordCount":161,"codeBlockCount":2}
